1
00:00:03,306 --> 00:00:07,561
<font color="white">你们就在此被击溃吧</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:08,270 --> 00:00:12,774
<font color="white">唯有那么做才能解放地球人</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:12,858 --> 00:00:15,944
<font color="white">使他们摆脱被强加在身上的正义</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:17,362 --> 00:00:19,781
<font color="white">那么我们开始吧</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:40,719 --> 00:00:43,472
<font color="white">我想战斗的对象</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:44,347 --> 00:00:46,224
<font color="white">就只有你一个人</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:46,308 --> 00:00:48,018
<font color="white">谁管那种事啊…</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:50,145 --> 00:00:54,191
<font color="white">就那点速度是无法伤到我的</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:01:02,491 --> 00:01:04,159
<font color="white">进次郎…</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:01:04,242 --> 00:01:08,413
<font color="white">伊多先生打算让进次郎成为光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:01:08,497 --> 00:01:09,664
<font color="white">若是让他得逞…</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:01:09,748 --> 00:01:14,544
<font color="white">喂 现在可无法从容地担心那些了</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:15,212 --> 00:01:19,049
<font color="white">是要我们对付这家伙是吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:25,388 --> 00:01:28,099
<font color="white">请放心 我会负责保护大家</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:28,183 --> 00:01:29,601
<font color="white">真可靠啊</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:01:29,684 --> 00:01:31,561
<font color="white">我们专心对付那个大块头吧</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:01:31,645 --> 00:01:32,938
<font color="white">-要上了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:03:01,776 --> 00:03:03,028
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:03:11,369 --> 00:03:16,416
<font color="white">为了与你一战 我特地准备这个擂台</font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:03:18,501 --> 00:03:22,839
<font color="white">希望各位地球人也能好好欣赏</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:03:28,053 --> 00:03:29,471
<font color="white">进次郎…</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:37,646 --> 00:03:40,190
<font color="white">你应该不只这点能力而已</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:40,273 --> 00:03:44,486
<font color="white">看你之所以不愿使出真正的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:44,986 --> 00:03:50,408
<font color="white">是因为你果然害怕</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">成为光之巨人对吧？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:55,622 --> 00:03:59,417
<font color="white">我对你抱持的宿命深感同情</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:04:00,293 --> 00:04:04,339
<font color="white">但你却把为保护地球而战</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:04:04,422 --> 00:04:09,761
<font color="white">和改变自我的恐惧放在天秤上衡量</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:04:13,348 --> 00:04:17,102
<font color="white">将你所有的力量都展现出来吧</font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:04:17,185 --> 00:04:20,105
<font color="white">光是打败这个状态的你</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:04:20,188 --> 00:04:23,733
<font color="white">根本无法解除人类身上的诅咒</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:04:39,624 --> 00:04:41,251
<font color="white">北斗</font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:04:54,973 --> 00:04:56,474
{\an8}<font color="white">大家…</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:05:09,029 --> 00:05:10,697
<font color="white">我能感觉到</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:16,119
<font color="white">真正的光之巨人快要在你体内诞生了</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:05:20,498 --> 00:05:21,458
<font color="white">解除限制器</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:05:21,541 --> 00:05:24,336
<font color="white">能量再次攀升 已超越负荷限制值了</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:05:24,419 --> 00:05:25,754
<font color="white">还能撑多久？</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:05:25,837 --> 00:05:28,006
<font color="white">大概三分钟 若是超越那时间…</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:05:29,424 --> 00:05:30,759
<font color="white">我不确定会有何后果</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:05:31,342 --> 00:05:34,846
<font color="white">莫非他真的会变成光之巨人？</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:05:34,929 --> 00:05:37,766
<font color="white">井手先生 积顿再次展开猛攻</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:05:37,849 --> 00:05:39,934
<font color="white">科学特搜队也出现损害</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:05:41,102 --> 00:05:43,188
<font color="white">星山、五条</font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:05:43,855 --> 00:05:46,191
<font color="white">这里交给你们了</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:05:46,274 --> 00:05:47,317
<font color="white">-遵命</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-遵命</font></font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:05:48,151 --> 00:05:49,652
<font color="white">万事拜托了</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:05:50,987 --> 00:05:52,363
<font color="white">井手先生…</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:05:55,366 --> 00:05:58,244
<font color="white">百慕拉 你这是打算做什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:58,828 --> 00:06:03,833
<font color="white">这一切都是我的行动所招致的结果</font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:06:03,917 --> 00:06:05,752
<font color="white">因此…</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:06:05,835 --> 00:06:08,713
<font color="white">住手 你的身体已经…</font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:06:09,339 --> 00:06:11,549
<font color="white">我要用尽最后一丝力量</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:06:11,633 --> 00:06:13,134
<font color="white">将你们…</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:06:13,218 --> 00:06:15,011
<font color="white">为什么要这么做？</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:06:15,512 --> 00:06:21,476
<font color="white">因为我无可救药地喜欢上地球人了</font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:06:27,982 --> 00:06:29,859
<font color="white">百慕拉…</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:06:34,781 --> 00:06:35,824
<font color="white">那家伙…</font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:06:35,907 --> 00:06:38,451
<font color="white">力量是不是比刚才更强了？</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:06:39,327 --> 00:06:40,411
<font color="white">那道光…</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:06:40,495 --> 00:06:43,289
<font color="white">看来那边的状况也同样难搞啊</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:06:43,373 --> 00:06:44,374
<font color="white">不</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:06:45,542 --> 00:06:47,293
<font color="white">那小子没问题</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:06:47,377 --> 00:06:50,463
<font color="white">我们只要专心打败眼前的敌人就好</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:06:50,547 --> 00:06:52,465
<font color="white">只好再用一次那招</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:06:52,549 --> 00:06:55,009
<font color="white">太郎先生 你不要急着送死</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:06:55,510 --> 00:06:57,095
<font color="white">可是已经没有其他办法了</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:06:57,178 --> 00:06:59,973
<font color="white">不对 还有一个办法</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:07:00,056 --> 00:07:01,224
<font color="white">井手先生？</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:07:04,769 --> 00:07:06,396
<font color="white">让你久等了</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:07:07,897 --> 00:07:08,982
<font color="white">这个给你</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:07:09,065 --> 00:07:10,233
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:07:10,316 --> 00:07:12,819
<font color="white">虽然不敢保证能像过去那样奏效</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:07:12,902 --> 00:07:14,696
<font color="white">总之只能奋力一搏了</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:07:14,779 --> 00:07:15,947
<font color="white">井手先生 积顿正要…</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:07:16,030 --> 00:07:16,865
<font color="white">什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:07:23,538 --> 00:07:27,125
<font color="white">看来我赶上了</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:07:27,208 --> 00:07:28,918
<font color="white">早田 你…</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:07:29,794 --> 00:07:30,712
<font color="white">快走吧</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:07:38,595 --> 00:07:40,680
<font color="white">-我们也前去掩护</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-明白</font></font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:07:45,518 --> 00:07:47,687
<font color="white">早田先生？别乱来啊</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:07:47,770 --> 00:07:52,525
<font color="white">面对有渊源的宿敌 我无法袖手旁观</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:08:15,298 --> 00:08:16,883
<font color="white">岚 就是现在</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:08:16,966 --> 00:08:18,134
<font color="white">（锁定目标）</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:08:18,218 --> 00:08:19,802
<font color="white">好</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:08:26,267 --> 00:08:27,685
<font color="white">他成功了</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:08:27,769 --> 00:08:29,479
<font color="white">-趁现在这机会</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:08:32,357 --> 00:08:35,485
<font color="white">剩下的就拜托你们了</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:08:36,945 --> 00:08:38,696
<font color="white">一口气收拾敌人</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:40,156
<font color="white">-好</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-收到</font></font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,074
<font color="white">明白</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:08:49,541 --> 00:08:51,793
<font color="white">把你斩成碎块</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:08:52,877 --> 00:08:55,588
<font color="white">天啊 他们把积顿逼入绝境了</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:08:55,672 --> 00:08:56,965
<font color="white">加油啊</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:08:57,048 --> 00:08:58,091
<font color="white">还没结束呢</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:09:03,555 --> 00:09:04,847
<font color="white">成功了</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:09:04,931 --> 00:09:07,308
<font color="white">不 还没结束 只能由我上了</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:09:07,392 --> 00:09:08,434
<font color="white">帮我一把</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:09:08,518 --> 00:09:09,519
<font color="white">太郎先生</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:09:14,232 --> 00:09:16,150
<font color="white">就是现在 展开防护罩</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:09:37,213 --> 00:09:38,172
<font color="white">积顿…</font><font color="white"></font>

101
00:09:39,465 --> 00:09:40,466
<font color="white">太郎</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,593
<font color="white">你没事吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:09:44,762 --> 00:09:46,306
<font color="white">我们赢了</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:09:46,389 --> 00:09:47,974
<font color="white">进次郎呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:10:06,492 --> 00:10:12,248
<font color="white">这确实是光之巨人的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:10:12,749 --> 00:10:17,253
<font color="white">不过我之所以存在</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:10:17,337 --> 00:10:20,632
<font color="white">就是为了击溃那股力量</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:10:46,616 --> 00:10:49,869
<font color="white">到此为止了 光之巨人啊</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:10:52,121 --> 00:10:56,084
<font color="white">从这星球的众人心中消逝吧</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:11:19,315 --> 00:11:21,442
<font color="white">灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:11:21,526 --> 00:11:23,403
<font color="white">就此终结了</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:11:23,486 --> 00:11:24,404
<font color="white">怎么可能？</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:11:24,487 --> 00:11:26,114
<font color="white">奥特曼…</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:11:26,864 --> 00:11:28,324
<font color="white">被打倒了</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:11:28,950 --> 00:11:29,951
<font color="white">活该</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:11:30,034 --> 00:11:31,160
<font color="white">真的是这样吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:11:32,161 --> 00:11:33,496
<font color="white">他一动也不动</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:11:33,579 --> 00:11:36,833
<font color="white">那又怎样？反正奥特曼就是灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:11:38,584 --> 00:11:40,044
<font color="white">可是…</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:11:53,641 --> 00:11:56,519
<font color="white">我赢不了他</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:11:58,729 --> 00:12:00,022
<font color="white">为什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:12:00,690 --> 00:12:03,151
<font color="white">我明明是光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:12:03,234 --> 00:12:05,611
<font color="white">他无法继续战斗了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:12:05,695 --> 00:12:07,572
<font color="white">我有什么办法嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:12:07,655 --> 00:12:09,490
<font color="white">我怎么可能打得赢积顿</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:12:10,324 --> 00:12:12,535
<font color="white">连爸都被它打倒了耶</font><font color="white"></font>

127
00:12:14,370 --> 00:12:17,874
<font color="white">我害怕自己</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:12:17,957 --> 00:12:20,501
<font color="white">逐渐迷失自我</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:12:21,210 --> 00:12:23,588
<font color="white">我希望他能再奋战</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:12:23,671 --> 00:12:26,757
<font color="white">你在胡说什么？不可能</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:12:26,841 --> 00:12:30,470
<font color="white">不过要是我放弃了 谁能对抗他？</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:12:31,304 --> 00:12:33,514
<font color="white">谁都不可能赢过那家伙的</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:12:33,598 --> 00:12:36,809
<font color="white">-没那回事</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-说得对</font></font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:12:37,310 --> 00:12:39,020
<font color="white">你看看那个坑洞</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:12:44,025 --> 00:12:47,862
<font color="white">他已经不是以前那个娇小的奥特曼了</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:12:50,156 --> 00:12:54,952
<font color="white">如果你有与那家伙一战之力</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你会怎么做？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:12:55,036 --> 00:12:57,580
<font color="white">这股力量…</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:12:57,663 --> 00:13:00,791
<font color="white">托付给我的这股力量…</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:13:00,875 --> 00:13:02,960
<font color="white">你们是地球的王牌</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:13:03,044 --> 00:13:06,506
<font color="white">就说了 他是真正的灾害</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:10,718
<font color="white">即使如此 他仍试图保护我们啊</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:13:10,801 --> 00:13:13,095
<font color="white">你是奥特曼 对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:13:13,179 --> 00:13:15,014
<font color="white">会变成这样都是他害的</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:13:15,097 --> 00:13:16,557
<font color="white">-你错了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:13:16,641 --> 00:13:19,936
<font color="white">-他才是真正的奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:13:20,019 --> 00:13:21,479
<font color="white">-他不曾找过借口…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:13:21,562 --> 00:13:23,940
<font color="white">-孤身奋战至今</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:13:24,023 --> 00:13:26,859
<font color="white">-学长…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:13:26,943 --> 00:13:29,946
<font color="white">真的是奥特曼呢</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:13:30,029 --> 00:13:32,198
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:13:32,281 --> 00:13:34,909
<font color="white">-拜托醒过来啊 奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:13:44,085 --> 00:13:45,253
<font color="white">没错</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:14:02,103 --> 00:14:04,438
<font color="white">这是怎么回事？</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:14:04,981 --> 00:14:06,357
<font color="white">不会吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:14:17,660 --> 00:14:19,412
<font color="white">奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:14:29,255 --> 00:14:30,965
<font color="white">上啊 奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:14:31,048 --> 00:14:33,467
<font color="white">-加油啊</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-奥特曼</font></font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:14:41,017 --> 00:14:43,603
<font color="white">看你那副模样…</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:14:43,686 --> 00:14:48,941
<font color="white">不 看来你并非光之巨人</font><font color="white"></font>

160
00:14:50,985 --> 00:14:54,822
<font color="white">光之巨人也好 外星人也罢</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:14:54,906 --> 00:14:56,657
<font color="white">跟那些都无关</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:14:59,243 --> 00:15:02,914
<font color="white">我是奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:15:06,792 --> 00:15:10,963
<font color="white">这才称得上是战斗的最高潮</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:15:59,804 --> 00:16:02,598
<font color="white">这股力量究竟是什么？</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:16:03,307 --> 00:16:04,475
<font color="white">（他真的是灾害吗？）</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:16:05,768 --> 00:16:07,436
<font color="white">上啊 奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:16:07,520 --> 00:16:10,189
<font color="white">太好了 干得好 奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:16:10,272 --> 00:16:12,775
<font color="white">你为什么要帮那个</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">如灾害般的家伙打气？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:16:12,858 --> 00:16:15,403
<font color="white">只有一件事我可以肯定</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:16:15,486 --> 00:16:18,322
<font color="white">奥特曼想保护我们</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:16:18,406 --> 00:16:21,951
<font color="white">我们不帮他加油 那还像话吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

172
00:16:29,250 --> 00:16:35,172
<font color="white">没想到奥特曼的信仰</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">已根深蒂固到这种地步</font></font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:16:35,965 --> 00:16:37,216
<font color="white">多么可悲啊</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:16:38,926 --> 00:16:41,262
<font color="white">你的想法才是大错特错</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:16:41,345 --> 00:16:44,557
<font color="white">在这颗星球上 众人的意志便是正义</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:47,935
<font color="white">我对此深信不疑</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:16:48,019 --> 00:16:51,355
<font color="white">那种东西可称不上是正义</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:16:51,439 --> 00:16:56,986
<font color="white">至少在我所熟知的宇宙中并非如此</font><font color="white"></font>

179
00:17:14,837 --> 00:17:16,839
<font color="white">对付他吧</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:17:16,922 --> 00:17:18,632
<font color="white">奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:17:22,386 --> 00:17:26,057
<font color="white">这不是装甲的力量</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:28,726
<font color="white">上啊 奥特曼</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:17:30,853 --> 00:17:31,937
<font color="white">进次郎…</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:17:43,407 --> 00:17:44,408
<font color="white">进次郎</font><font color="white"></font>

185
00:17:55,878 --> 00:17:57,088
<font color="white">各位</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:17:59,715 --> 00:18:03,094
<font color="white">你还磨蹭什么？你是奥特曼吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:18:03,677 --> 00:18:04,637
<font color="white">是的</font><font color="white"></font>

188
00:18:57,148 --> 00:19:00,818
<font color="white">每当你经过一次又一次的觉醒</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:19:02,153 --> 00:19:07,867
<font color="white">都会使更加偏颇的正义留在这地球上</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:19:08,450 --> 00:19:10,494
<font color="white">那么做是错的</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:19:11,245 --> 00:19:14,081
<font color="white">或许是那样没错 不过…</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:19:15,416 --> 00:19:17,585
<font color="white">正因为如此</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:19:17,668 --> 00:19:20,754
<font color="white">我必须不断寻找应当前进的道路</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:19:20,838 --> 00:19:24,466
<font color="white">那就是我现在能得出的答案</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:19:25,176 --> 00:19:27,428
<font color="white">我会在另一个世界</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:19:28,637 --> 00:19:31,432
<font color="white">看着事情的始末</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,452
<font color="white">对了 你们两个</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:19:51,535 --> 00:19:54,038
<font color="white">真的打算不做了吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:19:54,121 --> 00:19:58,459
<font color="white">是啊 这次事件刚好是个不错的契机</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:19:58,542 --> 00:20:01,921
<font color="white">科学特搜队应该交给新的世代</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:20:02,004 --> 00:20:02,838
<font color="white">是啊</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:20:02,922 --> 00:20:04,173
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:20:04,256 --> 00:20:09,720
<font color="white">不过呢 就算退休了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">你也要一直保持这样的你喔</font></font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:20:09,803 --> 00:20:11,263
<font color="white">对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:20:11,347 --> 00:20:13,390
<font color="white">什么？那句话是…</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:20:13,474 --> 00:20:14,391
<font color="white">这个嘛…</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:20:14,475 --> 00:20:17,061
<font color="white">真的非常抱歉</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:20:17,144 --> 00:20:19,104
<font color="white">请抬起头来</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:20:19,688 --> 00:20:20,814
<font color="white">早田先生</font><font color="white"></font>

210
00:20:21,857 --> 00:20:26,528
<font color="white">请你要一直保持这样的你喔</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:20:28,113 --> 00:20:32,326
<font color="white">是过去的某人对我说过的重要话语</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:20:36,497 --> 00:20:40,960
<font color="white">没想到我会被派遣到日本啊</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:20:41,043 --> 00:20:42,086
<font color="white">喂</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:20:43,003 --> 00:20:46,090
<font color="white">这里是太郎 我们已抵达现场上空</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:20:46,173 --> 00:20:47,883
<font color="white">少发牢骚了 杰克</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:20:47,967 --> 00:20:52,388
<font color="white">好啦 请你下命令 诸星老板</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:20:53,555 --> 00:20:57,768
<font color="white">不 诸星新任队长</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:21:01,272 --> 00:21:02,940
<font color="white">允许开始攻坚</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:21:04,441 --> 00:21:07,319
<font color="white">将那帮混帐外星人赶尽杀绝</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:21:07,987 --> 00:21:09,321
<font color="white">-遵命</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-遵命</font></font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:21:11,073 --> 00:21:13,575
<font color="white">我看过昨天的电视节目了</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:21:13,659 --> 00:21:16,245
<font color="white">那名教授好像被你精彩地驳倒了</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:21:16,328 --> 00:21:19,123
<font color="white">我那样还算有手下留情</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:21:19,206 --> 00:21:22,793
<font color="white">要是没扎拉比的证词可是会出大事的</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:21:22,876 --> 00:21:24,003
<font color="white">是吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:21:25,254 --> 00:21:26,880
<font color="white">你还是老样子耶</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:21:27,715 --> 00:21:28,716
<font color="white">话说回来</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:21:29,300 --> 00:21:31,510
<font color="white">你最近跟学长有联系吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:21:31,593 --> 00:21:34,805
<font color="white">有 他说现在过得很好</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:21:34,888 --> 00:21:36,140
<font color="white">是喔</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:21:36,640 --> 00:21:38,350
<font color="white">-你看</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-我瞧瞧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:21:39,310 --> 00:21:40,644
<font color="white">这样啊</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:21:41,645 --> 00:21:42,896
<font color="white">挺行的嘛</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:22:02,791 --> 00:22:04,126
<font color="white">遵命</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:22:07,463 --> 00:22:11,008
<font color="white">那么我要突袭了</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:23:57,114 --> 00:24:02,161
<font color="white">机动奥特曼 最终季</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:24:03,954 --> 00:24:07,749
<font color="white">是喔 结果只剩你一人活下来啊</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:24:07,833 --> 00:24:09,877
<font color="white">这只能说我实力非凡吧</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:11,962
<font color="white">你出卖了自己的手足啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:24:12,045 --> 00:24:14,173
<font color="white">别讲得那么难听</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:24:15,340 --> 00:24:16,258
<font color="white">欢迎光临</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:24:16,341 --> 00:24:17,593
<font color="white">找到了</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:24:17,676 --> 00:24:20,137
<font color="white">天啊 你还活着啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:24:20,220 --> 00:24:21,138
<font color="white">我还以为你…</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:24:21,221 --> 00:24:25,142
<font color="white">真是遗憾啊 我可是很擅长装死</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:24:27,978 --> 00:24:30,355
<font color="white">总之我们先干杯吧</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:24:30,439 --> 00:24:31,773
<font color="white">干杯</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:24:32,357 --> 00:24:35,819
<font color="white">天啊 那边不是</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">也有一个人跟我一样吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:24:35,903 --> 00:24:39,406
<font color="white">是很擅长装死的公主殿下</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:42,117
<font color="white">那帮大叔女仆呢？</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:24:42,201 --> 00:24:44,494
<font color="white">少啰嗦 别烦我啦</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:24:44,578 --> 00:24:48,290
<font color="white">我说你啊 在外头见到面</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">别找我说话好吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:24:48,373 --> 00:24:49,875
<font color="white">我也是个好人</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:24:49,958 --> 00:24:51,168
<font color="white">你少在那边胡说了</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:24:51,960 --> 00:24:54,713
<font color="white">-老板 再来一盘串烧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-马上来</font></font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:24:54,796 --> 00:24:59,635
<font color="white">天啊 各位齐聚一堂啊</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:24:59,718 --> 00:25:01,094
<font color="white">-我要老样子的</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-好</font></font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:25:01,178 --> 00:25:05,807
<font color="white">所以你们在此预谋</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">怎么打倒奥特曼吗？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:25:05,891 --> 00:25:08,060
<font color="white">在说什么蠢话啊？</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:25:08,143 --> 00:25:12,731
<font color="white">不只伊多、佩丹跟王牌杀手</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">就连梅菲斯特都被打倒了耶</font></font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:25:12,814 --> 00:25:15,651
<font color="white">现在不流行抵抗他们好吗？</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:25:15,734 --> 00:25:17,152
<font color="white">对吧？</font><font color="white"></font>

263
00:25:17,236 --> 00:25:18,695
<font color="white">说得对啊</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:25:19,279 --> 00:25:20,781
<font color="white">那还真是可惜</font><font color="white"></font>

265
00:25:20,864 --> 00:25:23,450
<font color="white">其实我打听到一个有趣的消息</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:25:23,533 --> 00:25:25,661
<font color="white">是关于星团评议会</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:25:25,744 --> 00:25:28,372
<font color="white">喂 拜托别再给我们惹麻烦了</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:25:28,455 --> 00:25:31,208
<font color="white">说这什么话？我可是非常欢迎</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:25:31,291 --> 00:25:33,752
<font color="white">你窝里反后就自以为了不起</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:25:33,835 --> 00:25:36,922
<font color="white">我可是还没闹够</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:25:37,005 --> 00:25:38,757
<font color="white">-吵死了</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-总而言之</font></font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:25:39,758 --> 00:25:41,510
<font color="white">我可不打算就这么结束</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:25:41,593 --> 00:25:42,803
<font color="white">给我五瓶热清酒</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:25:42,886 --> 00:25:44,221
<font color="white">-五瓶？</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-马上来</font></font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:25:45,222 --> 00:25:46,974
<font color="white">不会结束的</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:25:47,057 --> 00:25:49,518
<font color="white">-只要这颗星球…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-她到底喝了几摊啊？</font></font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:25:49,601 --> 00:25:51,979
<font color="white">-还存在着奥特曼</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-我看应该去过三间店了吧</font></font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:25:52,062 --> 00:25:54,106
<font color="white">-是串烧</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-不知道好不好吃</font></font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:27:30,327 --> 00:27:32,245
<font color="white">字幕翻译：梁雪莹</font><font color="white"></font>

